+| Component | default | loading | empty | error | offline/stale |
+|---|---|---|---|---|---|
+| Quality gate CLI | Ready but unexecuted; no verdict. | Prints RUNNING with real version/project/count. | Zero selection is FAIL, never PASS. | Non-zero with gate-specific summary and artifact path; retry-only is flaky FAIL. | Missing engine/app is BLOCKED with no result; configured/hosted but unexecuted is NOT RUN. |
+| Compatibility result | Five journeys × three engines expected. | Engine/journey arms execute independently. | Missing/zero arm fails the manifest. | Names tested engine and journey and retains trace/screenshot. | Browser prerequisite missing is BLOCKED, never “unsupported.” |
+| Accessibility result | Nine scans plus behavioral checks expected. | Waits for a state-specific ready/error anchor before axe. | Missing/skipped scan fails. | Serious/critical fails; all severities remain in artifact. | A real product finding enters GATE Z; only the narrow expiring waiver can exempt a proven false positive/third-party node. |
+| Visual result | Six current-platform Chromium baselines expected. | Waits for fonts and named ready state. | Missing baseline fails without creation. | Pixel mismatch fails with expected/actual/diff. | Another platform's baseline is not substituted; unavailable hosted platform stays NOT RUN. |
+| Candidate update | `compare_failed`; unreachable from every check path. | Valid receipt permits `authorized → candidates_written` only. | Missing/invalid receipt or zero candidates is non-zero with no write. | Partial/out-of-inventory/hash-mismatched writes fail and evidence is incomplete. | `accepted|rejected` comes only from the durable code-review receipt; two clean comparisons alone cannot invent acceptance. |
